    "chunk_text": "mid drium handum on morgenne & on \u00e6fenne \u00fea handa & \u00fea fet Wi\u00fe heardum swile \u00fe\u00e6s magan sele \u00feu him sealte mettas & haran fl\u00e6sc & eofores, rudan wyrttruman L\u00e6cedom wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s magan a\u00feundennesse, \u00fe\u00e6s mannes fet & handa man sceal swi\u00fee on morgentidum Wi\u00fe unluste & wl\u00e6ttan \u00fee of magan cym\u00f0 & be his mete sele him neahtnestigum wermod o\u00f0\u00f0e & gebeorh \u00fe\u00e6t hie ungemeltnesse ne \u00ferowian & god win geh\u00e6t & hluttor \u00feicgen on neaht nestig & Eft wi\u00fe metes unluste genim su\u00feerne cymen, of\u00fe\u00e6ne mid ecede, adrige \u00f0onne & gegnid on mortere \u00deises \u00feu nytta ge on \u00e6fenne ge on underne. Nis \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00fe \u00feam unluste anum god \u00fe\u00e6s magan ac eallum \u00feam lichoman \u00fe\u00e6t deah. Wi\u00fe metes unluste, dweorgedwostlan on w\u00e6tre of\u00fe\u00e6nde gegnid mid ecede, sele drincan wi\u00f0 wl\u00e6ttan. Wi\u00fe unluste eft mintan & pipores nigan corn gegniden on wine sele drincan. \u00deis sceal wi\u00f0 adeadodum magan, genim huniges & eced tog\u00e6dere gemenged & gebeatenne pipor, Sele him eac neahtnestigum \u00feis, genim eced wi\u00fe gl\u00e6denan gemenged hw\u00e6thwega & langes pipores Ge\u00feenc \u00f0u \u00feonne hw\u00e6\u00fere \u00fe\u00e6tte ealle \u00fea \u00e6rgenemnedan l\u00e6cedomas & \u00fea \u00e6fterwritenan ne sculon on Wi\u00fe forsogenum magan o\u00fe\u00fee a\u00feundenum genim hry\u00feeren fl\u00e6",
